WEBVTT

1
00:00:51.462 --> 00:00:54.000
In the previous verses, Lord Krishna

2
00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:57.577
gave a glimpse of His divine vibhutis.

3
00:00:57.577 --> 00:01:00.269
Now in these verses, upon Arjun's

4
00:01:00.269 --> 00:01:01.731
prayer, Lord Krishna

5
00:01:01.731 --> 00:01:03.077
agrees to describe

6
00:01:03.077 --> 00:01:05.885
His principal vibhutis.

7
00:01:05.885 --> 00:01:09.346
He explains that His glory is infinite,

8
00:01:09.346 --> 00:01:10.154
so

9
00:01:10.154 --> 00:01:12.192
He will shed light only on certain

10
00:01:12.192 --> 00:01:14.077
important aspects.

11
00:01:14.077 --> 00:01:15.462
Lord Krishna declares

12
00:01:15.462 --> 00:01:17.000
that He is the Paramatma –

13
00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:19.269
the Supreme Soul residing
in the hearts of all beings –

14
00:01:19.269 --> 00:01:22.269
and that He alone is the origin,

15
00:01:22.269 --> 00:01:25.269
sustainer, and end of all creation.

16
00:01:30.077 --> 00:01:31.115
Lord Krishna

17
00:01:31.115 --> 00:01:32.000
acknowledges Arjun's

18
00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:33.269
sincere curiosity

19
00:01:33.269 --> 00:01:36.192
with the word 'hanta',

20
00:01:36.192 --> 00:01:39.000
a sign of joy and compassion.

21
00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:41.115
He is ready to share

22
00:01:41.115 --> 00:01:44.000
the details of His divine vibhutis,

23
00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:46.346
but makes clear

24
00:01:46.346 --> 00:01:48.077
that He will describe

25
00:01:48.077 --> 00:01:49.615
only the principal ones,

26
00:01:49.615 --> 00:01:53.231
since His glories are infinite.

27
00:01:53.231 --> 00:01:55.538
These specially chosen

28
00:01:55.538 --> 00:01:58.846
descriptions help Arjun

29
00:01:58.846 --> 00:02:01.192
and other seekers,

30
00:02:01.192 --> 00:02:03.692
even while living in the material world,

31
00:02:03.692 --> 00:02:08.231
to centre their minds on Lord Krishna's divinity.

32
00:02:08.231 --> 00:02:11.154
Lord Krishna declares,

33
00:02:11.154 --> 00:02:14.231
'I am the Paramatma residing in the hearts

34
00:02:14.231 --> 00:02:16.115
of all beings.'

35
00:02:16.115 --> 00:02:18.538
This statement underlines

36
00:02:18.538 --> 00:02:22.038
His deep presence within every living being,

37
00:02:22.038 --> 00:02:24.346
not as an impersonal force,

38
00:02:24.346 --> 00:02:25.846
but as the guiding

39
00:02:25.846 --> 00:02:29.000
and witnessing Paramatma.

40
00:02:29.000 --> 00:02:34.000
The phrase 'sarva-bhutashaya-sthitah' reveals

41
00:02:34.000 --> 00:02:35.577
that He dwells in all

42
00:02:35.577 --> 00:02:38.115
as the spiritual essence.

43
00:02:38.115 --> 00:02:40.000
He establishes a direct connection between

44
00:02:40.000 --> 00:02:42.885
the finite and the infinite.

45
00:02:42.885 --> 00:02:45.385
This refutes the notion

46
00:02:45.385 --> 00:02:48.385
that the divine presence is formless

47
00:02:48.385 --> 00:02:50.615
or vague.

48
00:02:50.615 --> 00:02:51.731
Instead,

49
00:02:51.731 --> 00:02:55.385
it affirms that Paramatma is personal,

50
00:02:55.385 --> 00:02:57.538
actively engaged in guiding

51
00:02:57.538 --> 00:03:01.308
and supporting all beings.

52
00:03:01.308 --> 00:03:03.692
Lord Krishna further says,

53
00:03:03.692 --> 00:03:09.692
'I am the beginning, middle,
and end of all beings,'

54
00:03:09.692 --> 00:03:13.731
showing His command over time and existence.

55
00:03:13.731 --> 00:03:15.192
He is the creator

56
00:03:15.192 --> 00:03:18.577
who initiates life, the sustainer

57
00:03:18.577 --> 00:03:20.308
who protects it

58
00:03:20.308 --> 00:03:21.885
through His powers,

59
00:03:21.885 --> 00:03:23.385
and the final destination

60
00:03:23.385 --> 00:03:27.115
into which all beings ultimately merge.

61
00:03:27.115 --> 00:03:29.000
This is reflected not only at the cosmic level

62
00:03:29.000 --> 00:03:30.808
in the roles of Brahma – creation,

63
00:03:30.808 --> 00:03:32.500
Vishnu – sustenance,

64
00:03:32.500 --> 00:03:33.538
and Shiva –

65
00:03:33.538 --> 00:03:35.769
dissolution,

66
00:03:35.769 --> 00:03:37.577
in the form of these activities,

67
00:03:37.577 --> 00:03:40.692
but also at the individual level,

68
00:03:40.692 --> 00:03:42.192
as Lord Krishna

69
00:03:42.192 --> 00:03:43.538
governs the soul's journey

70
00:03:43.538 --> 00:03:44.692
from birth through death

71
00:03:44.692 --> 00:03:47.808
and beyond.

72
00:03:47.808 --> 00:03:49.423
The beauty of this teaching

73
00:03:49.423 --> 00:03:52.192
lies in its practicality.

74
00:03:52.192 --> 00:03:54.692
This knowledge redirects seekers' attention

75
00:03:54.692 --> 00:03:57.577
away from fleeting worldly things

76
00:03:57.577 --> 00:04:00.077
and toward their eternal source –

77
00:04:00.077 --> 00:04:02.846
Lord Krishna Himself,

78
00:04:02.846 --> 00:04:05.000
encouraging them to go toward Him.

79
00:04:05.000 --> 00:04:07.462
By seeing Him in all things,

80
00:04:07.462 --> 00:04:09.192
devotees deepen their connection

81
00:04:09.192 --> 00:04:11.654
with the divine.

82
00:04:11.654 --> 00:04:13.538
They transform their ordinary life

83
00:04:13.538 --> 00:04:17.115
into opportunities for devotion.

84
00:04:17.115 --> 00:04:18.500
In the coming verses,

85
00:04:18.500 --> 00:04:21.192
Lord Krishna will describe His various vibhutis

86
00:04:21.192 --> 00:04:22.538
in detail,

87
00:04:22.538 --> 00:04:23.500
giving Arjun

88
00:04:23.500 --> 00:04:26.885
and all seekers a new perspective

89
00:04:26.885 --> 00:04:28.731
on divinity.

90
00:04:33.577 --> 00:04:37.269
Walking on life's path,

91
00:04:37.269 --> 00:04:39.154
sometimes

92
00:04:39.154 --> 00:04:43.538
we find ourselves alone.

93
00:04:43.538 --> 00:04:47.385
It feels as if

94
00:04:47.385 --> 00:04:52.000
no one is with us.

95
00:04:52.000 --> 00:04:54.385
In such moments,

96
00:04:54.385 --> 00:04:57.115
always remember,

97
00:04:57.115 --> 00:05:00.885
within your heart

98
00:05:00.885 --> 00:05:05.692
I am always present.

99
00:05:05.692 --> 00:05:10.231
Just as the sun, even when covered

100
00:05:10.231 --> 00:05:15.731
by clouds, remains in the sky,

101
00:05:15.731 --> 00:05:17.692
in the same way

102
00:05:17.692 --> 00:05:19.154
I

103
00:05:19.154 --> 00:05:24.692
always reside within your inner self.

104
00:05:24.692 --> 00:05:26.500
I am not far

105
00:05:26.500 --> 00:05:30.000
or unreachable.

106
00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:33.038
I am within you,

107
00:05:33.038 --> 00:05:36.038
seeing you,

108
00:05:36.038 --> 00:05:39.577
guiding you,

109
00:05:39.577 --> 00:05:43.654
and supporting you.

110
00:05:43.654 --> 00:05:46.654
When you feel lost

111
00:05:46.654 --> 00:05:49.500
or alone,

112
00:05:49.500 --> 00:05:51.846
for a few moments

113
00:05:51.846 --> 00:05:53.769
bring your attention

114
00:05:53.769 --> 00:05:58.154
to your inner self.

115
00:05:58.154 --> 00:06:01.154
Close your eyes,

116
00:06:01.154 --> 00:06:04.038
take a deep breath.

117
00:06:04.038 --> 00:06:08.000
Recall My teachings

118
00:06:08.000 --> 00:06:11.808
and connect with Me.

119
00:06:11.808 --> 00:06:14.808
Just as a thirsty deer

120
00:06:14.808 --> 00:06:17.654
chases a mirage,

121
00:06:17.654 --> 00:06:23.808
but does not recognise the real source of water –

122
00:06:23.808 --> 00:06:26.423
in the same way, a person

123
00:06:26.423 --> 00:06:31.231
searches for peace in the outer world,

124
00:06:31.231 --> 00:06:35.308
while it is present within them all along.

125
00:06:35.308 --> 00:06:41.538
I am a source of compassion and knowledge.

126
00:06:41.538 --> 00:06:45.077
Whenever you reach out,

127
00:06:45.077 --> 00:06:50.385
I am ready to lift you up.

128
00:06:50.385 --> 00:06:52.462
Through this connection,

129
00:06:52.462 --> 00:06:56.500
you receive not only comfort,

130
00:06:56.500 --> 00:06:59.038
but also strength

131
00:06:59.038 --> 00:07:02.577
and clarity to move forward.

132
00:07:02.577 --> 00:07:07.154
Loneliness is only an illusion,

133
00:07:07.154 --> 00:07:12.154
one that fades in the light of this truth.

134
00:07:12.154 --> 00:07:14.500
Always hold firm trust

135
00:07:14.500 --> 00:07:17.269
in your eternal connection

136
00:07:17.269 --> 00:07:20.577
with Me.

137
00:07:20.577 --> 00:07:23.615
With every breath,

138
00:07:23.615 --> 00:07:27.192
you draw closer to Me.

139
00:07:27.192 --> 00:07:31.500
When you connect with Me

140
00:07:31.500 --> 00:07:34.500
from within,

141
00:07:34.500 --> 00:07:37.077
you find

142
00:07:37.077 --> 00:07:41.846
that love, knowledge, and peace

143
00:07:41.846 --> 00:07:44.577
were always

144
00:07:44.577 --> 00:07:48.500
just a few steps away from you.

145
00:07:53.269 --> 00:07:55.846
Have you ever wondered

146
00:07:55.846 --> 00:07:58.615
how to resolve complex

147
00:07:58.615 --> 00:08:02.192
relationships in family and society,

148
00:08:02.192 --> 00:08:04.769
when everyone is of different

149
00:08:04.769 --> 00:08:09.115
views and temperaments?

150
00:08:09.115 --> 00:08:13.346
In your family life, remember –

151
00:08:13.346 --> 00:08:15.192
I reside

152
00:08:15.192 --> 00:08:20.192
in the heart of every person.

153
00:08:20.192 --> 00:08:21.769
This understanding

154
00:08:21.769 --> 00:08:24.077
can change the way you see

155
00:08:24.077 --> 00:08:27.846
and treat your loved ones.

156
00:08:27.846 --> 00:08:29.500
It can transform.

157
00:08:29.500 --> 00:08:33.115
When you feel My presence

158
00:08:33.115 --> 00:08:35.808
in every family member,

159
00:08:35.808 --> 00:08:38.577
you no longer see them only as people

160
00:08:38.577 --> 00:08:41.308
with strengths and flaws,

161
00:08:41.308 --> 00:08:44.192
but begin to see them as sacred

162
00:08:44.192 --> 00:08:47.231
souls connected to Me.

163
00:08:47.231 --> 00:08:48.769
This perspective

164
00:08:48.769 --> 00:08:53.462
gives you the ability to honour each relationship

165
00:08:53.462 --> 00:08:58.538
with respect, patience, and compassion.

166
00:08:58.538 --> 00:09:01.423
Just as a gardener

167
00:09:01.423 --> 00:09:04.385
understands the needs of different plants

168
00:09:04.385 --> 00:09:08.231
in the garden

169
00:09:08.231 --> 00:09:10.038
and tends to each plant

170
00:09:10.038 --> 00:09:13.385
according to its nature,

171
00:09:13.385 --> 00:09:15.577
in the same way you too,

172
00:09:15.577 --> 00:09:16.769
each family member's

173
00:09:16.769 --> 00:09:20.692
uniqueness understanding,

174
00:09:20.692 --> 00:09:23.308
can care for them.

175
00:09:23.308 --> 00:09:25.308
When there is disagreement at home,

176
00:09:25.308 --> 00:09:28.808
remember that the same divine power

177
00:09:28.808 --> 00:09:32.731
that guides you also

178
00:09:32.731 --> 00:09:35.077
guides others.

179
00:09:35.077 --> 00:09:38.000
This understanding helps you

180
00:09:38.000 --> 00:09:40.769
show compassion instead of anger,

181
00:09:40.769 --> 00:09:43.385
and instead of finding fault,

182
00:09:43.385 --> 00:09:46.500
to seek understanding.

183
00:09:46.500 --> 00:09:49.731
When you see Me

184
00:09:49.731 --> 00:09:52.269
in the hearts of all,

185
00:09:52.269 --> 00:09:56.115
then your family becomes a
centre of mutual respect,

186
00:09:56.115 --> 00:09:58.038
love, and spiritual

187
00:09:58.038 --> 00:10:01.115
growth,

188
00:10:01.115 --> 00:10:08.615
where every soul moves
toward its full blossoming.

189
00:10:13.462 --> 00:10:16.769
When a senior manager in an office

190
00:10:16.769 --> 00:10:20.269
guides their team,

191
00:10:20.269 --> 00:10:21.769
they recognise the hidden capacities

192
00:10:21.769 --> 00:10:23.615
within them,

193
00:10:23.615 --> 00:10:25.462
and help them shine.

194
00:10:25.462 --> 00:10:28.038
Just as

195
00:10:28.038 --> 00:10:34.846
I see the possibilities within you.

196
00:10:34.846 --> 00:10:38.846
In your professional life, remember,

197
00:10:38.846 --> 00:10:42.731
I am the beginning,

198
00:10:42.731 --> 00:10:45.654
middle, and end of all things.

199
00:10:45.654 --> 00:10:49.500
Of your professional efforts too.

200
00:10:49.500 --> 00:10:52.077
When you begin a new project

201
00:10:52.077 --> 00:10:54.462
or task,

202
00:10:54.462 --> 00:10:57.654
seek My guidance.

203
00:10:57.654 --> 00:11:00.615
With faith and clarity,

204
00:11:00.615 --> 00:11:06.000
you will receive the strength
to lay a solid foundation.

205
00:11:06.000 --> 00:11:08.000
In the middle phase of life,

206
00:11:08.000 --> 00:11:12.077
when challenges and uncertainties come,

207
00:11:12.077 --> 00:11:16.577
recognise Me as the sustainer.

208
00:11:16.577 --> 00:11:18.385
I

209
00:11:18.385 --> 00:11:21.577
give you patience and understanding

210
00:11:21.577 --> 00:11:25.385
to face difficulties.

211
00:11:25.385 --> 00:11:29.308
Trust that at every step

212
00:11:29.308 --> 00:11:31.846
I am with you.

213
00:11:31.846 --> 00:11:34.269
When something ends –

214
00:11:34.269 --> 00:11:38.115
like a deal falling through,

215
00:11:38.115 --> 00:11:40.462
a project being completed,

216
00:11:40.462 --> 00:11:44.692
or a phase of business closing,

217
00:11:44.692 --> 00:11:47.846
even there know

218
00:11:47.846 --> 00:11:51.000
that My blessing is present.

219
00:11:51.000 --> 00:11:55.154
If there is an obstacle or
a door ahead seems closed,

220
00:11:55.154 --> 00:11:57.692
do not see this as failure.

221
00:11:57.692 --> 00:12:01.615
Know it instead as a signal

222
00:12:01.615 --> 00:12:04.038
that you should change direction.

223
00:12:04.038 --> 00:12:06.808
A new door, a new path

224
00:12:06.808 --> 00:12:10.115
is waiting for you.

225
00:12:10.115 --> 00:12:12.577
This obstacle is not an end,

226
00:12:12.577 --> 00:12:16.385
but a new beginning.

227
00:12:16.385 --> 00:12:20.885
When you see every stage of your work

228
00:12:20.885 --> 00:12:23.192
as part of a vast

229
00:12:23.192 --> 00:12:26.385
spiritual journey,

230
00:12:26.385 --> 00:12:30.654
then you are able to complete
your work with peace

231
00:12:30.654 --> 00:12:36.769
and with a higher purpose.

232
00:12:36.769 --> 00:12:38.615
I am the beginning,

233
00:12:38.615 --> 00:12:40.346
I am the middle,

234
00:12:40.346 --> 00:12:42.808
I am also the end.

235
00:12:42.808 --> 00:12:46.577
I am with you at all times.